# 这里只填写你自己的连接信息。程序按本文件中 Host 的首次出现顺序连接。
# Only enter your own connection details here. Hosts are tried in first-appearance order.
# 只取消所需 Host 示例前的 #；下方说明文字保持注释。无需在 config.toml 再填写列表。
# Uncomment only the Host examples you need. No separate endpoint list is required.
#
# Host host_name_1
#     User user_name
#     HostName host_address
#     Port 1234
#     IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
#     IdentitiesOnly yes
#
# Host host_name_2
#     User user_name
#     HostName host_address
#     Port 5678
#
# 多个别名可写在同一 Host 行，按从左到右排序；重复别名只尝试一次。
# Host *、通配符及 ! 排除规则不作为连接目标。Match 不新增目标。
# 将代理目标的明确 Host 别名写在本文件；Include 可用于原生 SSH 设置。
# Shared timeouts/keepalives are managed in config.toml. Host trust uses OpenSSH defaults.
#
# ===== 中文：如何配置免密码登录 =====
# 免密码登录指 SSH 密钥认证；不是把密码写进此文件。OpenSSH 没有 Password 配置项。
# 1. 已有可用密钥时直接使用，不要覆盖。没有时在本机终端执行：
#       ssh-keygen -t ed25519
#    按提示保存（通常是 ~/.ssh/id_ed25519），建议设置密钥口令以保护私钥。
# 2. 将公钥文件 id_ed25519.pub 的内容交给服务器管理员，加入远端登录账户的
#    公钥授权配置。Linux/macOS 服务端通常是 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys，目录权限 700、
#    文件权限 600。也可先用密码登录远端完成这一步。绝不要上传或分享无 .pub 的私钥。
#    Windows 查看公钥：Get-Content "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_ed25519.pub"
#    macOS/Linux 查看公钥：cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub
# 3. IdentityFile 指向本机私钥。使用默认密钥/agent 时可以省略；使用上面的
#    IdentitiesOnly yes 时，应保留对应 IdentityFile，避免选错密钥。
# 4. 私钥有口令时先加载进本机 ssh-agent；输入一次口令后后台代理才能无提示登录。
#    Windows：如果 ssh-agent 服务未启用，在管理员 PowerShell 中执行：
#       Set-Service -Name ssh-agent -StartupType Automatic
#       Start-Service ssh-agent
#    再在使用代理的普通用户 PowerShell 中执行：
#       ssh-add "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_ed25519"
#    macOS：使用登录会话自带的 agent，执行：
#       ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
#    Linux：优先使用登录会话的 agent。若当前终端没有 agent，可执行：
#       eval "$(ssh-agent -s)"
#       ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
#    用 ssh-add -l 检查密钥是否已加载；重启/重新登录后如有需要再次加载。
# 5. 在安装目录打开终端，先确认服务器指纹（向管理员核对），再测试无交互登录：
#    Windows：
#       .\ssh_proxy_cli.exe trust host_name_1
#       ssh -F ./ssh_config -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes host_name_1 exit
#    macOS/Linux：使用 ./ssh_proxy_cli trust host_name_1，后面的 ssh 测试命令相同。
#    测试无任何密码提示且成功退出后，再启动代理。每台服务器都需要授权你的公钥。
# 主机信任记录使用 OpenSSH 默认文件（通常 ~/.ssh/known_hosts），无需在应用目录创建。
# trust 只确认身份并登录，不会自动安装公钥或保存密码。密码认证成功不代表免密已配置好。
#
# ===== English: set up passwordless SSH =====
# Passwordless login uses SSH keys, not a password stored in this file. There is no Password directive.
# 1. Reuse an existing working key; do not overwrite it. Otherwise run locally:
#       ssh-keygen -t ed25519
#    Follow the prompts (normally ~/.ssh/id_ed25519). A key passphrase protects the private key.
# 2. Give only id_ed25519.pub to the server administrator for your remote account's key authorization.
#    On Linux/macOS servers this is usually ~/.ssh/authorized_keys (directory 700, file 600).
#    An initial password login may be used to install the public key. Never share the private key.
#    View the public key on Windows: Get-Content "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_ed25519.pub"
#    On macOS/Linux: cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub
# 3. IdentityFile names the LOCAL private key. It is optional for default keys/agent use.
#    With IdentitiesOnly yes, keep the matching IdentityFile so OpenSSH selects the intended key.
# 4. Load passphrase-protected keys into the local agent before starting the background proxy.
#    Windows, if ssh-agent is disabled: in elevated PowerShell run the following:
#       Set-Service -Name ssh-agent -StartupType Automatic
#       Start-Service ssh-agent
#    Then, in your regular user's PowerShell:
#       ssh-add "$env:USERPROFILE\.ssh\id_ed25519"
#    macOS: use the login session's agent and run ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
#    Linux: prefer the login session's agent. If this shell has none, run:
#       eval "$(ssh-agent -s)"
#       ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
#    Check with ssh-add -l; reload after reboot/sign-in if your agent needs it.
# 5. From the installed folder, verify the server fingerprint, then test noninteractive login:
#       .\ssh_proxy_cli.exe trust host_name_1
#       ssh -F ./ssh_config -o BatchMode=yes -o StrictHostKeyChecking=yes host_name_1 exit
#    On macOS/Linux use ./ssh_proxy_cli trust host_name_1; the ssh test command is the same.
#    Start the proxy only after this succeeds without a password prompt. Authorize each server.
# Host trust stays in native OpenSSH files (usually ~/.ssh/known_hosts); no app-specific file is needed.
# trust does not install keys or save passwords. Successful password login alone is not enough.
